- Typer — MIT
- Uvicorn — BSD-3-Clause
- Appium-Python-Client (mobile extra) — Apache-2.0
- NumPy (mobile/game/AI extras) — BSD-3-Clause
- OpenCV (game/mobile/AI extras) — Apache-2.0
- MSS (game extra) — MIT
- PyAutoGUI (game extra) — BSD-3-Clause
- pynput (game extra) — LGPL-3.0-or-later
- pytesseract (game extra) — Apache-2.0; the Tesseract executable is a
